[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9603.67, "timestamp": "02:40:03", "text": "比如 2026 年或 2027 年的 Joathons。把它放进去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.95, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "对警察来说，正当的理由等等都是对的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9610.95, "timestamp": "02:40:10", "text": "就像那样，嗯，就像那样，再一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9612.95, "timestamp": "02:40:12", "text": "这又不是强迫别人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9615.03, "timestamp": "02:40:15", "text": "就像当时被刀指着之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9616.309, "timestamp": "02:40:16", "text": "你就像是，嘿，如果你想的话……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9618.79, "timestamp": "02:40:18", "text": "支持，没问题，是的，那些人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9620.469, "timestamp": "02:40:20", "text": "支持就像真心想要的那样，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9623.91, "timestamp": "02:40:23", "text": "完全没问题，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9625.03, "timestamp": "02:40:25", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9628.55, "timestamp": "02:40:28", "text": "那真是太好了，我希望……我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9631.67, "timestamp": "02:40:31", "text": "一切顺利，哦耶"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9633.67, "timestamp": "02:40:33", "text": "我想存钱。是的。我希望一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9636.55, "timestamp": "02:40:36", "text": "进展也很顺利。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9638.15, "timestamp": "02:40:38", "text": "嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9640.71, "timestamp": "02:40:40", "text": "呃，等等，你是什么时候开始的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9644.469, "timestamp": "02:40:44", "text": "流媒体管道之类的东西？嗯，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9647.429, "timestamp": "02:40:47", "text": "管道。我想我开始了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9650.63, "timestamp": "02:40:50", "text": "20 21"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9653.11, "timestamp": "02:40:53", "text": "问号。我想大概就是那个时候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9655.75, "timestamp": "02:40:55", "text": "感觉好像已经过了四年了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9658.15, "timestamp": "02:40:58", "text": "我记得的就是这样。所以，嗯，就是这样。"}]